        <tr> 
          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>CIW invites SoF out to Kael to help kill AoW!                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">Our friends from CIW invited SoF out to Kael to help kill the very famour, Avatar of War.  At 8 p.m. Est we set out for Kael, heading to the arena to kill the Vindicator and Statue.  Of course it was laggy and many of us went LD but we still killed Vindi and the Statue easily.<br><br>After the Statue was killed we headed back to the Wakenings Lands Entrance in Kael to prepare for AoW!  We had approximatly 100 people, roughly 35 SoF, 50 Clan Icewind, and the rest from various guilds.  Finally AoW came and we began the long battle.  Unfortunatly for us many of us once again went LD (including me) and missed some of the battle, although only 100 were there for AoW 150 were in the zone, and we all know how Kael does with more than 100 people =/<br><br>Even though we could not kill AoW, we did get it down to 60% and had a blast doing it.  Everyone there had so much fun and it was one of the coolest raids, in my own opinion.  I also learned that AoW can kill you before you even realize that you have zoned back into Kael, ie, death loop! Eep, I saw about 8 Charisi corpses out there /snicker   <br><br>Also while there, a few loots dropped<br><br>Gratz Epicurus on your silk gloves!<br>Gratz Ikthog on your chain bracer!<br><br>Gratz to all those in CIW who got loots (I dont know names =(<br><br>Once again, Thank you VERY much CIW for inviting SoF out to Kael for an awesome raid!!  CIW rocks!                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      